  "description": "Bring a touch of timeless English charm to your creative projects with this Vintage London Storybook Watercolor Clipart Set. Inspired by nostalgic antique British illustrations and cozy Victorian Christmas aesthetics, each element is beautifully detailed with fine ink outlines, muted watercolor washes, subtle paper textures, and soft faded pigments.\nAll graphics are provided as high-resolution PNG files with clean transparent backgrounds, making them completely isolated and ready to overlay on any color or texture.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED:\n14 High-Resolution PNG Files (Isolated on transparent background)\nResolution: 300 DPI (High-quality print ready)\nPERFECT FOR:\nChristmas & Holiday Greeting Cards\nJunk Journaling & Scrapbooking\nPlanner Stickers & Printables\nNursery & Wall Art Prints\nSublimation (Mugs, T-Shirts, Tote Bags, Coasters)\nParty Invitations & Stationery\nPackaging & Branding Projects\n♡ THANK YOU FOR VISITING! ♡\nThank you so much for stopping by my shop! I hope these hand-painted watercolor elements bring joy, nostalgia, and inspiration to your wonderful projects. If you have any questions, feel free to contact me. Happy crafting! ✨",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring a touch of timeless English charm to your creative projects with this Vintage London Storybook Watercolor Clipart Set. Inspired by nostalgic antique British illustrations and cozy Victorian Christmas aesthetics, each element is beautifully detailed with fine ink outlines, muted watercolor washes, subtle paper textures, and soft faded pigments.</p>\n<p>All graphics are provided as high-resolution PNG files with clean transparent backgrounds, making them completely isolated and ready to overlay on any color or texture.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED:<br>\n14 High-Resolution PNG Files (Isolated on transparent background)<br>\nResolution: 300 DPI (High-quality print ready)</p>\n<p>PERFECT FOR:<br>\nChristmas &amp; Holiday Greeting Cards<br>\nJunk Journaling &amp; Scrapbooking<br>\nPlanner Stickers &amp; Printables<br>\nNursery &amp; Wall Art Prints<br>\nSublimation (Mugs, T-Shirts, Tote Bags, Coasters)<br>\nParty Invitations &amp; Stationery<br>\nPackaging &amp; Branding Projects</p>\n<p>♡ THANK YOU FOR VISITING! ♡</p>\n<p>Thank you so much for stopping by my shop! I hope these hand-painted watercolor elements bring joy, nostalgia, and inspiration to your wonderful projects. If you have any questions, feel free to contact me. Happy crafting! ✨</p>",
